{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The casual eco-simulation game <strong>Desktop Vivarium</strong> turns your desktop into a live backdrop, so you can tend your ecosystem while you work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Real-Time Dynamic Desktop</strong><br>Launch the game and your desktop instantly becomes an interactive 3D ecosphere. Watch your fish grow and your plants flourish\u2014bringing a touch of tranquility to your work or study breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Sandbox Terrain Editing</strong><br>Inspired by Minecraft\u2019s block system, you can craft a one-of-a-kind underwater landscape at any time using a variety of materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Open-World Foraging Expeditions</strong><br>Travel the globe to collect rare flora, fauna, and decorative elements to enrich your ecosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Multiple Ecosphere Sizes</strong><br>Whether your screen is wide or narrow, landscape or portrait, there\u2019s a perfectly fitting ecosphere to match your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Multiple Tanks</strong><br>One ecosphere isn\u2019t enough? Run two\u2014or three\u2014or more, and turn all your monitors into cradles of life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1677960?t=1750586895","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1677960?t=1750586895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677960/8b142bf2f552b093e1bb98274db6a0aa3d41c047/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750586895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677960/8b142bf2f552b093e1bb98274db6a0aa3d41c047/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750586895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"